        },
        {
          "height": 32,
          "id": 2,
          "name": "Fossil reviver",
          "point": false,
          "rotation": 0,
          "type": "npc_spawn",
          "visible": true,
          "width": 32,
          "x": 320,
          "y": 96,
          "properties": [
            {
              "name": "npcId",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "fossil_reviver"
            },
            {
              "name": "sprite",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "scientist"
            },
            {
              "name": "trainer",
              "type": "bool",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "name": "originalId",
              "type": "int",
              "value": 2
            },
            {
              "name": "dialog",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Oh, hello. I'm a scientist.\nI can turn fossils into living, breathing Pok\u00e9mon!\nAiyah! You come again!\nDo you have a fossil for me?\nWhich fossil do you want me to revive?\nLet me know when you want me to revive a\nfossil for you.\nOkay. I'll see if I can revive your .\nCome back later.\nI'll be here if you want my help."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "height": 32,
          "id": 3,
          "name": "PC",
          "point": false,
          "rotation": 0,
          "type": "event",
          "visible": true,
          "width": 32,
          "x": 32,
          "y": 32,
          "properties": [
            {
              "name": "originalId",
              "type": "int",
              "value": 3
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "height": 32,
          "id": 4,
          "name": "Fossil combiner",
          "point": false,
          "rotation": 0,
          "type": "npc_spawn",
          "visible": true,
          "width": 32,
          "x": 160,
          "y": 96,
          "properties": [
            {
              "name": "npcId",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "fossil_combiner"
            },
            {
              "name": "sprite",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "scientist"
            },
            {
              "name": "trainer",
              "type": "bool",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "name": "originalId",
              "type": "int",
              "value": 4
            },
            {
              "name": "dialog",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Hello, huh! My name is Carl Ess. I can turn\ncombinations of partial Fossils into living, breathing\nPok\u00e9mon!\nHm? You've got some Fossils there, huh. Will you\nshow them to me, Carl Ess?\nWhich of your Fossils do you think stands up to the\nhigh standards of Carl Ess?\nWhich of your Fossils do you think stands up to the\nhigh standards of Carl Ess?\nWhich of your Fossils do you think stands up to the\nhigh standards of Carl Ess?\nWhich of your Fossils do you think will pique the\ncuriosity of Carl Ess?\nWhich of your Fossils do you think will pique the\ncuriosity of Carl Ess?\nWhich of your Fossils do you think will pique the\ncuriosity of Carl Ess?\nCome see me when you have some interesting\nFossils.\nSo I should restore the Fossilized Bird and the\nFossilized Drake together, huh?\nSo I should restore the Fossilized Bird and the\nFossilized Dino together, huh?\nSo I should restore the Fossilized Fish and the\nFossilized Drake together, huh?\nSo I should restore the Fossilized Fish and the\nFossilized Dino together, huh?\nOK. Restoration time. Let's unravel the mystery of\nthese Fossils!\nAll right, I'll stick 'em together! Here... we... GO!\nObjective complete. It seems the restoration was a\ngreat success.\nYes, I can see it in its eyes. This is a Pok\u00e9mon that\nwalked the face of Essen in ancient times! Please\ntake and care for this Pok\u00e9mon, huh.\nOh, you don't have space in your party, huh. Make\nsome room and then come back here for your\nPok\u00e9mon.\nOh. They don't seem to work together.\nMaybe some other time, then."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
